sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Home as HomeScreen
    participant Set as SettingsScreen
    participant DS as DetectorSettings
    participant Prefs as SharedPreferences
    participant Session as LipsCameraSession

    User->>Home: taps the gear icon
    Home->>Set: Navigator.push(SettingsScreen)
    Set->>DS: load()
    DS->>Prefs: getDouble x3
    Prefs-->>DS: saved values or defaults
    DS-->>Set: DetectorSettings
    Set->>User: three sliders shown

    User->>Set: drags a slider
    Set->>Set: setState with copyWith
    Note over Set: change held in memory only,<br/>nothing written yet

    alt user taps Save
        User->>Set: taps "Save Settings"
        Set->>DS: save()
        DS->>Prefs: setDouble x3
        Prefs-->>DS: written
        Set->>User: SnackBar "Settings saved"
    else user taps Reset
        User->>Set: taps "Reset to defaults"
        Set->>Set: sliders back to defaults
        Note over Set: still nothing written
    end

    User->>Set: presses Back
    Set-->>Home: pop
    Home->>Session: applyDetectorSettings()
    Session->>DS: load()
    DS-->>Session: latest thresholds
    Session->>Session: rebuild LipsingDetector<br/>and LipLetterDetector
    Note over Session: fresh detectors also clear<br/>stale frame history
    Home->>User: detection now uses new values
